OL,3,GNEWSABrand's #3k donation to victims'
OL,4,Acharity after rape
OL,5,
OL,6,FRussell Brand made a donation to a rape
OL,7,Fcrisis charity in his hometown a year
OL,8,Fafter committing the offence himself,
OL,9,Fit has emerged.
OL,11,FThe donation of #3,000 was given to
OL,12,FSouth Essex Rape and Incest Crisis
OL,13,FCentre (SERICC) in the disgraced
OL,14,Fentertainer's name, to help pay for its
OL,15,F25th anniversary party.
OL,17,FThe charity, based at Grays, in
OL,18,FThurrock, Essex, received the money in
OL,19,Flate 2010. Brand has since been
OL,20,Fconvicted of raping a 21-year-old woman
OL,21,Fin 2009.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
